<body>
<div dir=3D"auto">Good morning, Logan!</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Thank you so much for the detailed explanation on the dif=
ferent ranger roles. So Seasonal Ranger Assistant it is. &#55357;&#56846;</=
div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Hopefully I get to help guests at the gatehouse if I land=
 that job! I think I would be amazing at it. I don't know why it appeals to=
 me so much -- I guess because a gate attendant helped me in Brookings and =
it kind of elevated the position in
 my mind.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I'm more than happy to do any maintenance role, just want=
 to note I have little experience with... Well maintenance. I lived on comp=
uters my whole life! So if it involves, like, maintaining equipment... Prob=
ably I would be very bad at this unless
 someone really wanted to mentor me. And I am all about learning these kind=
s of skills at this stage of my life (never had an interest in my younger d=
ays so I find this evolution of myself kind of interesting).</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Don't mind hard work of course. I'm replacing all the tra=
ction things at Tugman this week and that's a lot more work than it appears=
 from the outside! But I'm loving it.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I'm really excited about coming to Honeyman. I just have =
a really good feeling about it. And I love working with Franki also so I fe=
el like maybe I found my place for part of the year!</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Sam</div>
<div><br>
</div>
