<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">Hi, Ranger Logan.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">Would it be possible to come back in May to work t=
he welcome center again? Assuming the position is still open (just perusing=
 the job board). I'll be at Umpqua in April (Franki found a spot for me) so=
 I'll still be in the area.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">The only caveat I would make to this is I'm going =
to try really hard to become a seasonal park ranger (as long as it's on the=
 coast), if they'll have me. I am unclear on when those jobs are posted and=
 filled so I just want to note this
 in case it causes a conflict if I am fortunately hired. Because of the two=
 year park service prerequisite, I'm unsure if I would get hired (it is the=
 main reason I'm volunteering).</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">I am open to any positions. I think I'm a very per=
sonable person so I like interesting with guests whether at the welcome cen=
ter or as campground host but I'm just as willing to clean yurts and do mai=
ntenance (I've been enjoying contributing
 to the infrastructure here at Tugman).</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
